'''Swordsman''' (剣士, ''Kenshi'', '''Swordsman''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Princess Punt Sweets Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 1.4 Update|Version 1.4]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Swordsman
|image = E 025.png
|first appearance = [[How Do You Say Yurinchi?]]
|latest appearance = [[Princess Punt Joins the Fight! (Hard)]]
|money drop = 800¢ - 3,160¢
}}

==Enemy==
A pathetic enemy with extremely low health, attack power and range. This enemy serves no threat to any player that comes across it. Use anything to defeat it as it will most likely die in one hit anyway.

